{{For|the Trick or Treater on public islands|Trick or Treater}}
The '''Trick or Treater''' is a mob that spawns during [[Spooky Festival]]s at night. 

== Spawning ==
'''Trick or Treaters''' can spawn on the {{Zone|Private Island}} in dark areas at night during a [[Spooky Festival]].

